OL,3,CPolice investigation after Dudley
OL,4,Cshooting
OL,6,FPolice are investigating after a man
OL,7,Fwas shot in Dudley.
OL,9,FOfficers said two groups met in
OL,10,FAmblecote Road, Brierley Hill, at
OL,11,Faround 2pm on Saturday, 15 August,
OL,12,Fwhen a fight broke out and one man was
OL,13,Fshot in the leg. He sustained injuries
OL,14,Fwhich are not life-threatening.
OL,16,FA number of people ran away, but two
OL,17,Fmen, aged 34 and 40, have been
OL,18,Farrested on suspicion of violent
OL,19,Fdisorder, and were taken into custody
OL,20,Ffor questioning.
