OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786898895
OL,3,CPolice investigation after Dudley
OL,4,Cshooting
OL,6,FWest Midlands Police said: "Our
OL,7,Fenquiries to establish the full
OL,8,Fcircumstances, and identify those
OL,9,Finvolved, remain ongoing. We're
OL,10,Freviewing CCTV as part of our
OL,11,Fenquiries.
OL,13,F"We understand the incident will have
OL,14,Fcaused concern in the community and
OL,15,Fwe've stepped up patrols in and around
OL,16,Fthe area. We won't tolerate any
OL,17,Fviolence, especially including guns."
